                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I honestly don’t know how to explain this game\r\n\r\nThis is not just a game it feels like it was made by a real human who put his heart and soul into every small detail\r\n\r\nThe story the atmosphere the characters everything feels so real and beautiful that sometimes I had to stop playing and just breathe\r\n\r\nThis game made me cry and I respect the person who made it so much\r\n\r\nNot because it tries too hard to make you emotional but because it feels human\r\n\r\nYou can feel the love and passion in every part of it\r\n\r\nSometimes you don’t finish a game\r\n\r\nSometimes the game stays with you\r\n\r\n10/10 I will remember this game for a long time ❤️",
